    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Jolly Land Adventure</i> is a bite-sized 2D platformer bursting with charm. With smooth movement, cheerful visuals, and quick levels designed for replay, it\u2019s the perfect pick-me-up for platformer fans of all ages.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pick up and play </strong>\u2013 No lengthy cutscenes or tutorials. Just start running and jumping.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic Platforming Fun</strong> \u2013 Precise jumps, smooth movement, and creative level design keep the action exciting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Colorful &amp; Cozy World</strong> \u2013 Traverse lively landscapes filled with secrets, surprises, and quirky characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relaxed &amp; Accessible</strong> \u2013 Easy to learn, fun to replay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Try the  demo</strong> \u2013 30 free levels of tight, joyful platforming.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Jolly Land Adventure</i> is a bite-sized 2D platformer bursting with charm. With smooth movement, cheerful visuals, and quick levels designed for replay, it\u2019s the perfect pick-me-up for platformer fans of all ages.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pick up and play </strong>\u2013 No lengthy cutscenes or tutorials. Just start running and jumping.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic Platforming Fun</strong> \u2013 Precise jumps, smooth movement, and creative level design keep the action exciting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Colorful &amp; Cozy World</strong> \u2013 Traverse lively landscapes filled with secrets, surprises, and quirky characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relaxed &amp; Accessible</strong> \u2013 Easy to learn, fun to replay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Try the  demo</strong> \u2013 30 free levels of tight, joyful platforming.</p>",
    "short_description": "Love the golden age of 2D platformers? Jolly Land Adventure brings back the joy of smooth jumps, colorful worlds, and creative levels in a fresh and accessible way. Whether you're a longtime platformer fan or new to the genre, there\u2019s plenty to enjoy!",
